{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1764120,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Vortexa 3.0- 12 Hour Hackathon","festival_id":null,"organization_id":1343235,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T08:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-12T20:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/vortexa-30-12-hour-hackathon-dr-d-y-patil-institute-technology-pimpri-pune-1764120","region":"offline","details":"<div class=\"d-flex\">\n<div class=\"my_sect ng-star-inserted\">\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow\">\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"7ecd5d55-5ba1-4a89-a54a-6a0e68abe11c\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-6\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\n<div class=\"fbskMG_root LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling\">\n<h2 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"ubzxna\" data-start=\"331\" data-end=\"370\">IMPORTANT &mdash; OFFICIAL REGISTRATION<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1h34nai\" data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"436\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"384\" data-end=\"436\">Unstop Registration &ne; Final VORTEXA Registration<\/strong><\/span><\/h3>\n<p><strong data-start=\"3\" data-end=\"17\">IMPORTANT:<\/strong> Don&rsquo;t worry about the Unstop registration count. Unstop registrations are <strong data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"105\">not final<\/strong>.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"438\" data-end=\"519\">The registration count shown on <strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"518\">Unstop represents initial registrations only<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"793\">All participants who have registered through Unstop <strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"792\">must complete the official VORTEXA registration process through our official portal<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"499\">Participants who register through Unstop must complete the <strong data-start=\"434\" data-end=\"467\">official VORTEXA registration<\/strong> through the event portal below.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"584\">\ufe0f <strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"542\">Official VORTEXA Registration:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"504\" data-end=\"584\"><span class=\"contents\" data-content-reference-start=\"545\" data-content-reference-end=\"613\"><span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https:\/\/campusmeet.in\/user\/user_event-details.php?id=166\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">VORTEXA Registration Portal<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"738\">The official portal is required for <strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"737\">team formation, payment submission, payment verification, registration confirmation and ticket\/QR generation<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"476\">Registering on Unstop alone does <strong data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"360\">not<\/strong> guarantee a confirmed slot. Teams must complete the official VORTEXA registration and payment verification process.<\/p>\n<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\" dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"rylqng\" data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"291\"><strong>VORTEXA 3.0 - 12-HOUR HACKATHON<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"320\"><strong data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"320\">Build. Innovate. Solve.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"322\" data-end=\"499\">VORTEXA 3.0 is a 12-hour offline hackathon bringing together students, developers, innovators, and problem-solvers to build technology-driven solutions to real-world challenges.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"692\">Hosted at <strong data-start=\"511\" data-end=\"568\">Dr. D. Y. Patil Institute of Technology, Pimpri, Pune<\/strong>, VORTEXA is designed for teams who want to turn ideas into working prototypes within a high-energy 12-hour build challenge.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"898\">Whether you're into AI\/ML, web development, app development, data science, automation, or emerging technologies, VORTEXA gives you the opportunity to build, collaborate, compete, and showcase your skills.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1rkcpbz\" data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"915\"><strong>Why Vortexa?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>12 hours of intense building and problem-solving<\/li>\n<li>Real-world problem statements<\/li>\n<li>Team-based innovation<\/li>\n<li>Mentorship and interaction with fellow builders<\/li>\n<li>Evaluation by judges<\/li>\n<li>Opportunity to showcase your project<\/li>\n<li>Certificates and prizes for winning teams<\/li>\n<li>An on-campus hackathon experience at DIT Pimpri<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"jw1hez\" data-start=\"1231\" data-end=\"1247\"><strong>Event Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1259\">Venue:<\/strong> Dr. D. Y. Patil Institute of Technology, Pimpri, Pune<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1350\"><strong data-start=\"1315\" data-end=\"1331\">Event Dates:<\/strong> 11&ndash;12 October 2026<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1387\"><strong data-start=\"1355\" data-end=\"1378\">Hackathon Duration:<\/strong> 12 Hours<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1415\"><strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1403\">Team Size:<\/strong> 2&ndash;4 Members<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1447\"><strong data-start=\"1417\" data-end=\"1432\">Prize Pool:<\/strong> Up to \u20b975,000*<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1466\"><strong data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1458\">Mode:<\/strong> Offline<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"175eubl\" data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1497\"><strong>Two-Day Event Breakdown:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"11umom\" data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1538\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1538\">11 October 2026 - Hackathon Day:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1540\" data-end=\"1601\">The first day will be dedicated to the <strong data-start=\"1579\" data-end=\"1600\">12-hour hackathon<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Team check-in and verification<\/li>\n<li>Opening briefing<\/li>\n<li>Problem statement briefing<\/li>\n<li>Problem selection<\/li>\n<li>12-hour development and building<\/li>\n<li>Testing and refinement<\/li>\n<li>Final project submission<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1792\" data-end=\"1871\">\ufe0f<strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1871\">Lunch will be provided to registered participants during the hackathon.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"123h10c\" data-start=\"1873\" data-end=\"1919\"><span role=\"text\"><strong data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1919\">12 October 2026 - Evaluation &amp; Results<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"1921\" data-end=\"2004\">The second day will focus on evaluating the solutions built by participating teams.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Project presentations and demonstrations<\/li>\n<li>Evaluation by the judging panel<\/li>\n<li>Final scoring and deliberation<\/li>\n<li><strong data-start=\"2118\" data-end=\"2141\">Result announcement<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Prize distribution<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2228\"><strong data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2228\">Participants should be available for both days of the event.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"53jl9u\" data-start=\"2230\" data-end=\"2253\"><strong>Who Can Participate?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2354\">VORTEXA is open to students and technology enthusiasts interested in building innovative solutions.<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2442\">Participants from different colleges, branches, and technical backgrounds are welcome.<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2493\">You can participate as a team of <strong data-start=\"2477\" data-end=\"2492\">2-4 members<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"18indsm\" data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2505\"><strong>Domains:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2578\">Teams Can Explore Problem Statements Across Technology Domains Such As:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning<\/li>\n<li>Web Development<\/li>\n<li>Software Development<\/li>\n<li>Emerging Technologies<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2691\" data-end=\"2772\">The Final Domains and Problem Statements Will Be Provided by The Organizing Team.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"sopy96\" data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2791\"><strong>Hackathon Flow:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"170f2ug\" data-start=\"2793\" data-end=\"2812\"><strong>Registration:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2814\" data-end=\"2875\">Register Your Team Through the Official Registration Process.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1e48xue\" data-start=\"2877\" data-end=\"2892\"><strong>Check-In:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2894\" data-end=\"2951\">Registered Teams Will Complete Verification at The Venue.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1m8qktx\" data-start=\"2953\" data-end=\"2977\"><strong>Problem Statement:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"2979\" data-end=\"3065\">Teams Will Receive\/access the Available Problem Statements and Select Their Challenge.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1kbw5my\" data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3079\"><strong>Build:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3156\">Teams Get <strong data-start=\"3091\" data-end=\"3103\">12 Hours<\/strong> to Design, Develop, Test, and Refine Their Solution.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1bbfaz9\" data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3175\"><strong>Submission:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3177\" data-end=\"3261\">Teams Submit Their Project and Required Documentation Before the Announced Deadline.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"11yb6dk\" data-start=\"3263\" data-end=\"3280\"><strong>Evaluation:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3282\" data-end=\"3373\">Projects Will Be Evaluated by The Judging Panel Based on The Announced Evaluation Criteria.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"18h8oyx\" data-start=\"3375\" data-end=\"3394\"><strong>Presentation:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3396\" data-end=\"3472\">Teams Will Present and Demonstrate Their Solutions Before the Judging Panel.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"llxuga\" data-start=\"3474\" data-end=\"3488\"><strong>Results:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3490\" data-end=\"3572\">Winning Teams Will Be Announced After the Final Evaluation on <strong data-start=\"3552\" data-end=\"3571\">11 October 2026<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"7cpmdm\" data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3593\"><strong>Judging Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3595\" data-end=\"3624\">Projects May Be Evaluated On:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Innovation<\/li>\n<li>Technical Implementation<\/li>\n<li>Problem Relevance<\/li>\n<li>Impact<\/li>\n<li>Feasibility<\/li>\n<li>User Experience<\/li>\n<li>Completeness of The Solution<\/li>\n<li>Presentation &amp; Demonstration<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3790\" data-end=\"3862\">The Final Scoring Framework Will Be Communicated by The Organizing Team.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"uo2zpg\" data-start=\"3864\" data-end=\"3880\"><strong>What to Bring:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3908\">Participants Should Carry:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Laptop<\/li>\n<li>Charger<\/li>\n<li>Required Development Equipment<\/li>\n<li>College Id<\/li>\n<li>Registration\/confirmation Details<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4012\" data-end=\"4070\">Teams Are Responsible for Their Own Development Equipment.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"i2dsbc\" data-start=\"4072\" data-end=\"4107\"><strong>After Successful Registration:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4109\" data-end=\"4343\">Once Your Team Successfully Completes the Registration Process, <strong data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4343\">All Important Event-Related Information and Further Instructions Will Be Communicated to The Registered Team Through the Contact Details Provided During Registration.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4345\" data-end=\"4384\">This May Include Information Regarding:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Event Schedule and Reporting Time<\/li>\n<li>Venue and Check-In Instructions<\/li>\n<li>Problem Statements<\/li>\n<li>Hackathon Guidelines<\/li>\n<li>Submission Process<\/li>\n<li>Presentation and Evaluation Process<\/li>\n<li>Other Important Event-Day Instructions<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"4601\" data-end=\"4722\">Participants Are Advised to Regularly Check Their Registered Email and Other Official Communication Channels for Updates.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"96r18j\" data-start=\"4724\" data-end=\"4736\"><strong>Important:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each Participant Can Be Part of Only One Team.<\/li>\n<li>Team Size Must Remain Within the Announced Limit.<\/li>\n<li>Participants Must Complete Venue Verification\/check-In.<\/li>\n<li>Participants Should Be Available on <strong data-start=\"4935\" data-end=\"4966\">Both 11 and 12 October 2026<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>Teams Must Submit Their Project Before the Announced Submission Deadline.<\/li>\n<li>Plagiarism or Submission of Substantially Copied Work May Lead to Disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Participants Must Follow the Event Code of Conduct and Instructions Provided by The Organizing Team.<\/li>\n<li>The Organizing Committee Reserves the Right to Modify the Schedule or Event Instructions when Necessary.<\/li>\n<li>Final Decisions of The Judging Panel Will Be Treated as Final.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-section-id=\"1l4t1vc\" data-start=\"5406\" data-end=\"5418\"><strong>Get Ready:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"5420\" data-end=\"5436\">Pick A Idea.<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"5438\" data-end=\"5458\">Build Your Solution.<\/li>\n<li dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"5460\" data-end=\"5481\">Solve Something Real.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"5483\" data-end=\"5548\"><strong data-start=\"5483\" data-end=\"5548\">Vortexa 3.0 - 12 Hours. One Challenge. Endless Possibilities.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" data-start=\"5550\" data-end=\"5633\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><em data-start=\"5550\" data-end=\"5633\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Prize pool and event details are subject to the official rules and announcements.<\/em><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","overall_prizes":"Prize Pool: Up to \u20b9100,000*","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":20168682,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-01T12:31:55+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-06T20:43:55+05:30","communication_sent":2,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype